WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
You are Eames.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.000
Inside the dream, Fischer has reached his father's bedside.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
He suspects you want control of what is inside the safe.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
He knows its combination. He will not hand it over.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Get him to say it before the dream collapses.
